     sceKernelIsNeoMode() ? 3840x2160 : 1920x1080, and every screen-sized target (the display buffers,
     the scene, the post-process chain at a quarter) follows it; the 1536x1536 shadow map does not.
     Each patch replaces the base PS4's 1920 and 1080 (mov ecx, imm32), so the game renders at that size
     on the base PS4 path. Found by SanctuaryPort; each site by its signature (Pattern/At). -->
